# Pull requests

Title: `type(scope): imperative summary`

Body is only this:

```md
## Summary

- One to three bullets. Why it changed.

## Test plan

- [ ] The checks this change needs.
```

No other sections. No sign-off. No AI attribution.

Squash-merge into `develop`. Release notes use the same Summary shape (`docs/releases.mdx`).
